    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Akwap ŋina abu toruwor ŋina asegan",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ani ikorakini iyoŋ Ŋisirael akwap ŋina eruwor ŋina a ŋolokabila, emaikina iyoŋ totyaka nawae aŋuna a Ekapolon akwap ŋina erae aoyau keŋ ŋakilomitae ŋatomon ka ŋaarei ta atutubet, torae auruwuanut ŋakilomitae ŋatomon. Emaikina akwap ŋin daadaŋ erae ŋina eseg. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tooma akwap ŋin, emaikina eyai akibois ŋina ipimim eriyan ŋiwaetin ŋuluomwon daadaŋ erae ŋimitae ŋamiae ŋaarei ka ŋatomonikan, nakibois ŋin iŋes edukokinio Akai ka Akuj, emaikina eyai kiŋa akibois ŋin neni elapat neni erae alolomu ŋimitae ŋatomoniarei ka ŋikan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alotooma akibois ŋina asegan ŋin, emaikina totyakae alokidiŋ eriyan, kipimunae atutubet apei erae aoyau alosepyon ŋakilomitae ŋatomon ka ŋaarei ka atutubet, torae ewae ŋolo euruwuana ŋakilomitae ŋakan. Eruwor nen edukokinio Akai ka Akuj ka eruwor akibois ŋin ŋina eseg akilo ŋakiboisyo daadaŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eruwor nen akibois ŋina eseg anakwap a Ŋisirael ka eruwor akibois a ŋisacaradotin a ŋulu itiyaete etic a Ekapolon anakibois keŋ a ŋina asegan, a ŋulu eapiyanarete kiŋaren Ekapolon akitiyanakin iŋes. Eruwor nen neni edukio ŋakais a ŋisacaradotin ka akibois ŋina asegan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emaikina atutubet ŋinace erae ŋina a ŋilepi a ŋulu itiyaete etic alo Kai ka Akuj. Emaikina todukoe ŋitaunio ŋulu iboiyoto ikes nen.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kipimakisi akibois ace diyete ŋina asegan, kipima aoyau keŋ alosepyon erae ŋakilomitae ŋatomon ka ŋaarei ta atutubet, torae aoyau alowaetin a ŋulu euruwuaka ŋakilomitae ŋaarei ka atutubet, emaikina totyakarae akibois ŋin aŋuna ke etaun a ŋolo epedorete Ŋisirael daadaŋ ŋulu ecamito akiboiyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Emaikina daŋ totyakakinae akibois neni a ekepukan. Emaikina ŋun totyakunae ameun alokukoru a ŋolo alo To akibois ŋina asegan tomyaa To Nanam Mediteranian ka alokukoru a ŋolo alo Kide akibois ŋina asegan, emaikina akibois ŋin tomyaa tari lokukor ŋolo ka akwap a Ŋisirael alowae a ŋolo alo Kide. Iriyanikin akibois ŋin eoya ka ŋina einakinitae lokabilae a Isirael. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eruwor akibois ŋin alo Isirael ŋina a ekepukan, ikotere emam alokepukak ŋini edemi ŋituŋa kaŋ ŋakiboisyo, nai torae ŋulu imyekinito akwap a Isirael erae ŋina a ŋikabilae a Isirael.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Alimu Ekapolon Akuj atemar, okoe ŋikepukak a Isirael, itiyata iyes akisec ŋinapei paaran, toesikisi aryenyeo ka akisicanit ŋuluce, kitiyata ŋuna ajokak ka ŋuna iyookino, tojoŋoto akirisit ŋituŋa kaŋ anakwap kec, ayoŋ Ekapolon Akuj akalimokinit iyes.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ŋiboro ŋulu ipimere apotis kori aoyau kori ibore ŋini aliwan",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Emaikina iyes iyakatar ŋiboro ŋulu ipimere apotis ŋulu iyookino ka ŋulu ipimere aoyau ŋulu iyookino ta ŋulu ipimere ibore ŋini aliwan ŋulu iyookino. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emaikina eriyan ŋiboorei ŋulu ipimere ibore ŋini aonon ka ŋulu ipimere ibore ŋini ecamunito ŋituŋa daadaŋ akipimya. Ŋakipimeta ikes nu: Omer epei, erae Epa ŋitomon ka Epa ŋitomon, erae Bas ŋitomon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emaikina ŋiboorei ŋulu ipimeta iyes apotis erae ikes lu: Ŋigeras ŋatomoniarei, erae ecekel epei, Ŋicekelia ŋatomonikanikapei, erae Emina epei.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ŋainakineta",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ŋainakineta ŋuna emaikina iyes iyaut ikes nu: Ŋaganoi emaikina erae atutubet apei alotooma ŋatomon alotyae a ŋolo ilemunito iyes. Ŋikinyom ŋulu ikote erau, emaikina erae atutubet apei alotooma ŋitomon a lotyae a ŋolo ilemunito iyes. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akimyet ŋina a ŋikito a Olipa, emaikina erae atutubet apei alotooma amiat a ŋina icuut iyes anaraito a ŋikito kus. (Kipima akimyet ŋin a ibore a ŋini ipimere ibore ŋini aliwan, Ŋibas ŋitomon, erae Omer epei, kori Ekor epei) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amesek apei alotooma ŋamesekin ŋamiae ŋaarei a ŋinadakari a Ŋisirael. Emaikina iyes yaut ŋainakineta a ŋuna a ŋikinyom ka a ŋuna a ŋibaren, toruwor ikes ŋainakineta ŋuna epeyo ka ŋuna ekisil, ikotere ikimookunere iyes anasecit kus. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emaikina ŋituŋa daadaŋ anakwap a Isirael yaut kaapei ka ekepukan ŋainakineta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nai erae etic a ekepukan alemunun ŋainakineta a ŋibaren ŋuna epeyo, ŋainakineta ŋuna a ŋikinyom, ŋainakineta ŋuna a ŋimaten. Emaikina iŋes kitiya ŋun a ŋuna a ŋituŋa a akwap keŋ apaki ŋina a ŋasuban a elap a ŋolokitete, a ŋasuban a Sabato ka anasuban a ŋunace daŋ. Emaikina iŋes yau ŋainakineta aŋuna ka asecit, ŋainakineta ŋuna epeyo ka ŋuna a ekisil aŋuna ka amookunia ŋituŋa alo Isirael.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ŋasuban ŋuna emaikina kitiyaetei",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Alimu Ekapolon Akuj atemar ani edoli elap ŋolo ke epei, ŋirwa a elap epei, emaikina iyes tolemut emoŋ ŋolosorokit ŋolo emam neni eŋwalit, kitaleunioto akibois ŋina asegan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emaikina esacaradoti tolemu ŋaokot ŋadi ŋuna ka ainakinet aŋuna ka asecit, kiosak nakito a epuke a Akai ka Akuj ka lokoonae ŋuluomwon anamuroet ŋulu alokidiama ta nakito ŋuna a ŋipukei a alapatu a ŋina alotooma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emaikina iyes kitiya ŋunapei ŋun edoli ŋirwa a elap ŋikanikaarei aŋuna a ituŋanan a daadaŋ a ŋini eseci pa iredakinit, kori pa sek eyeni; emaikina iyes tomookut Akai ka Akuj.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
