            "sid": "EZK 45:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ani edoli elap ŋolo ke epei, ŋirwa a elap ŋitomon ka ŋiomwon, emaikina iyes kinumunuma ŋasuban ŋuna a Paska, tonyama ŋamugati ŋuna emam ŋakinyalet ŋirwa ŋikanikaarei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akoloŋit ŋin, emaikina ekepukan tolemu aŋuna keŋ ka aŋuna a ŋituŋa a daadaŋ emoŋ ŋolosorokit ŋolo erae ainakinet aŋuna ka asecit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alotooma ŋirwa ŋikanikaarei ŋulu a ŋasuban, emaikina ekepukan tolemu aŋuna a Ekapolon ŋimoŋin ŋulusorok ŋikanikaarei ka ŋimeesekin ŋikanikaarei ŋulu nyeŋwalito erae ŋainakineta ŋuna epeyo. Emaikina iŋes kitiya ŋun a ŋinakoloŋit alotooma ŋirwa ŋulukanikaarei ŋul ka emaikina iŋes tolemu ekoroe a ŋinakoloŋit erae ainakinet aŋuna ka asecit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emaikina iŋes tolemu ainakinet ŋina aŋikinyom apeikilo aŋuna ke emoŋ a epei, apeikilo a ŋuna a emesek a epei ka ŋilitae ŋiomwon ŋulu ka akimyet aŋuna ka akilo ka apei a ŋina a ŋikinyom. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani edoli elap ŋolo a ŋikanikaarei, ŋirwa a elap ŋitomon ka ŋikan ka alotooma ŋirwa ŋulukanikaarei ŋulu a ŋasuban ŋul, emaikina ekepukan tolemu ŋamuja ŋunapei ŋun aŋuna a ŋainakineta aŋuna ka asecit, aŋuna epeyo ka aŋuna a ŋikinyom ta ŋuna ka akimyet.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
